			<div class="section-head">
				<h2>2021</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="section-body">
				<p>A few years later, in 2021, there were another set of local elections. This time, the network’s vision was to have several different local TV studios, with local hosts, telling the viewership about the situation in their area of the country. They each were to use the same result visualization system, controlled by an iPad. Needless to say, this was a big change and a big challenge.</p>
				<p>This time, my colleague Mads built a new TypeScript-based project to be shown on the iPads and the monitors next to the host. It was built mostly from scratch, and my role was to give input in the development process based on my experience with prior elections, and to help in the stakeholder relations.</p>
