				<h2>2022 referendum</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="section-body">
				<p>2022 brought two different election-related projects I was working on. The first was an EU referendum. I took the work done for the previous election and adapted it to a simple “yes”/“no” vote design, and worked with the new host who presented results.</p>
