<div class="content-segment">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section">
			<div class="section-head">
				<h2>2022 parliament election</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="section-body">
				<p>The last election project I participated in, and a big one. An important national parliament election. For this one, I had a less of a hands-on role, instead overseeing and guiding two colleagues doing most of the work developing extra features on the software. And there were a lot of new additions.</p>
				<p>Most notably, the centerpiece of the new election studio was 14 huge bar shaped monitors. At this point, the list of parties participating in the election in Denmark on a national level was getting pretty long. Fourteen parties, and there was a bar for each one. Through the evening, the vision was that these were going to show the live results for each party all night.</p>
				<p>So, my colleagues and I prepared our application to output a design fitting exactly the specification and design for these monitors, with many different view modes.</p>
