					<figcaption><strong class="figcaption-prefix">Above:</strong> One of the bigger features our colleagues and I had worked tirelessly on was an <em>interactive majority visualization</em>; once we have an idea how many mandates each party will get, which coalitions are possible? And which will attain a majority in the parliament? The host would be able to build prospective coalitions on screen. Not every feature or detail we build makes it all the way to the show, so when this visualization finally was used — seen here during the live broadcast — we sat back on the sidelines and smiled.</figcaption>
				</figure>
